\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Temperature controls output randomness. Range: 0\'962. At 0, model picks highest-probability token (deterministic). At 1+, distribution is more uniform (creative/random). Use 0 for RAG/factual tasks, 0.7\'961 for creative generation. Also related: top-p (nucleus sampling) and top-k sampling.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
